{"schema_version":2,"id":"p304-holidays-grandmother","revision":1,"title_en":"Holidays with grandmother","title_zh":"与祖母共度的假期","level":"B1","primary_topic":"daily_life","tags":["daily_life","family","vacation"],"source_type":"licensed_adaptation","fiction":true,"summary_zh":"住在城市里的兄妹奥东戈和阿皮约期盼着学校假期，前往乡村探望祖母。在湖畔村落里，他们向慈爱勤劳的祖母学习生火、煮茶、挤牛奶、做玉米糊，并跟随祖母去市集卖农产、买生活用品。假期尾声，祖母赠送他们各种礼物，孩子们恋恋不舍地告别乡村，带着深厚的亲情重返城市校园。","featured":false,"admitted_at":"2026-11-22T02:56:16Z","paragraphs":[{"sentences":[{"id":"s1","text":"Odongo and Apiyo lived in the city with their father.","separator_after":" ","translation_zh":"奥东戈和阿皮约和他们的父亲住在城市里。","tokens":[{"start":0,"end":6,"surface":"Odongo","lemma":"Odongo","pos":"专有名词","gloss_zh":"奥东戈（人名）"},{"start":7,"end":10,"surface":"and","lemma":"and","pos":"连词","gloss_zh":"和；与"},{"start":11,"end":16,"surface":"Apiyo","lemma":"Apiyo","pos":"专有名词","gloss_zh":"阿皮约（人名）"},{"start":17,"end":22,"surface":"lived","lemma":"live","pos":"动词","gloss_zh":"居住；生活"},{"start":23,"end":25,"surface":"in","lemma":"in","pos":"介词","gloss_zh":"在……之中"},{"start":26,"end":29,"surface":"the","lemma":"the","pos":"冠词","gloss_zh":"这座"},{"start":30,"end":34,"surface":"city","lemma":"city","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"城市"},{"start":35,"end":39,"surface":"with","lemma":"with","pos":"介词","gloss_zh":"和……一起"},{"start":40,"end":45,"surface":"their","lemma":"they","pos":"代词","gloss_zh":"他们的"},{"start":46,"end":52,"surface":"father","lemma":"father","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"父亲"}],"phrases":[]},{"id":"s2","text":"They looked forward to the holidays.","separator_after":" ","translation_zh":"他们非常期盼放假。","tokens":[{"start":0,"end":4,"surface":"They","lemma":"they","pos":"代词","gloss_zh":"他们"},{"start":5,"end":11,"surface":"looked","lemma":"look","pos":"动词","gloss_zh":"盼望（look forward to结构）"},{"start":12,"end":19,"surface":"forward","lemma":"forward","pos":"副词","gloss_zh":"向前"},{"start":20,"end":22,"surface":"to","lemma":"to","pos":"介词","gloss_zh":"到；向"},{"start":23,"end":26,"surface":"the","lemma":"the","po